<title>ITALY: TABLE - Italy May producer prices rise 1.1 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Italy May producer prices rise 1.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian producer price data for May.</p>
<p>    PRODUCER PRICES	     May 97   April 97     May 96</p>
<p>    Year/year change	    +1.1     +0.8 pct     +1.5 pct (r)</p>
<p>    Month/month change	  +0.1     +0.0 pct     -0.2 pct</p>
<p>    Index (base 1995=100)    103.0	102.9	  101.9 (r)</p>
</text>
